        "npc": [
            {
                "i": 5,
                "orig": "Did you know that you can change your character at the world map screen?",
                "talk": "您知道如何在大地图中更换角色吗？",
                "u": true
            },
            {
                "i": 48,
                "orig": "#if player(3)\nDid you like my gift?\n#else\nI hope that was helpful.\n#endif",
                "talk": "#if player(3)\n你喜欢我送给你的礼物吗？\n#else\n希望对你的冒险有帮助。\n#endif",
                "u": true
            },
            {
                "i": 49,
                "orig": "#if player(3)\nOh, Your Highness! It's such an honor to see you, Princess! I have a gift for you, let me open the chest...\n#elif player(4)\nHello, bro! What's up? Take the thing from the chest, you'll need it!\n#elif player(5)\nOh, you that hero from a far kingdom that everyone keep talking about? Here, you can have what's in this chest.\n#else\nAren't you that plumber that everyone keeps talking about? Here, you can have what's in this chest.\n#endif",
                "talk": "#if player(3)\n哦，公主殿下！见到你是我的荣幸，让我打开宝箱看看……\n#elif player(4)\n哥哥您好！什么事？去打开宝箱，可能有您需要的东西！\n#elif player(5)\n原来是来自远方的英雄啊……您有什么想表达的？去打开宝箱，看看里面有什么惊喜吧！\n#else\n原来是水管工啊……您有什么想表达的？去打开宝箱，看看里面有什么惊喜吧！\n#endif",
                "u": true
            }
        ]
    },
